  "downloads": 61,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">What is this?</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>An addon for <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2628/tarkov-craft-loader\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">TarkovCraft Loader</a> that adds new hideout production recipes focused on medical supplies — craft essential meds directly from your Medstation instead of relying solely on traders or the flea market.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Recipes</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">Result Item</th>\n<th align=\"center\">Medstation</th>\n<th align=\"center\">Time</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Key Components</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Salewa</strong></td>\n<td align=\"center\">Level 1</td>\n<td align=\"center\">35 min</td>\n<td align=\"left\">AI-2, Bandages, Esmarch, KEKTAPE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>IFAK</strong></td>\n<td align=\"center\">Level 1</td>\n<td align=\"center\">45 min</td>\n<td align=\"left\">Army Bandage, Analgin, Pile of Meds</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Calok-B</strong> ×2</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Level 2</td>\n<td align=\"center\">55 min</td>\n<td align=\"left\">Saline Solution, Bandages, Med Tools</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Adrenaline</strong> ×2</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Level 2</td>\n<td align=\"center\">40 min</td>\n<td align=\"left\">Caffeine, Syringe, Med Tools</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Surv12</strong></td>\n<td align=\"center\">Level 2</td>\n<td align=\"center\">110 min</td>\n<td align=\"left\">CMS, Aluminum Splint, Insulating Tape</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Morphine</strong> ×2</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Level 3</td>\n<td align=\"center\">70 min</td>\n<td align=\"left\">Ibuprofen, Analgin, Saline, Syringes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Propital</strong> ×2</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Level 3</td>\n<td align=\"center\">95 min</td>\n<td align=\"left\">Golden Star, Ibuprofen, Syringes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Grizzly</strong></td>\n<td align=\"center\">Level 3</td>\n<td align=\"center\">135 min</td>\n<td align=\"left\">Salewas, Calok-B, Splints</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download the latest release <code>.zip</code> file</li>\n<li>Drag and drop the files directly into the <code>TarkovCraft Loader</code> folder, merging with the existing folders</li>\n<li>The folders should merge automatically. If prompted to overwrite files, click <strong>Yes</strong></li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Requirements</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.sp-tarkov.com\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPT</a> <code>4.x.x</code> or higher</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2628/tarkov-craft-loader\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">TarkovCraft Loader</a> <code>1.x.x</code> or higher</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Issues</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Issues? Open one <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/viniHNS/TarkovCraft-Addon-Medical-Care/issues\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">HERE</a></p></div></div></div>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/Q5Q116JYQN\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"ko-fi\" /></a></p>\n",
